1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,530
I'm Helen Kane. I'm your lawyer. What name did you give the police?

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,130
The one on the card.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,400
I need you to say it. Not point.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,380
There are patient records in my bag. Those people didn't agree to any of this.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,980
Please. Keep their names out of this.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:49,940
I can ask to protect their names. I can't make the records disappear. First I need to know what's in there.

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,980
I don't want them paying for this.

8
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:06,530
We'll deal with the names. Where was the bag when they grabbed you?

9
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,980
By your foot, or in the aisle?

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,960
They moved it away from my foot. I got up. Then they cuffed me.

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,280
And the bag?

12
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,260
Over there. They'd already moved me when he opened it.

13
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,700
Could you reach it?

14
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,830
No. He had my arm. I couldn't even turn.

15
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,130
So they can't use it?

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,260
I haven't seen the video. Don't get ahead of me.

17
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,550
What else did you tell them?

18
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,960
Even the bad stuff. I can't hear it for the first time in court.

19
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:38,660
I got those samples through mutual aid. That person had no idea what I was going to do.

20
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:46,110
Did they tell you that? Or did you just never tell them?

21
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,700
I never told them.

22
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,530
Then that's what we can say. What they knew is a separate question.

23
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,130
Okay. Write it that way.

24
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:17,620
Three networks called. This one wants you to read from the notebook. On camera.

25
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:33,570
From when they arrived to when they drove off. Not just the bit with the cuffs.

26
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:39,980
Send them the statement. His rights, that's it. Nothing from the notebook.

27
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:50,140
This is his first dated entry. He hadn't even booked New York yet.

28
00:03:50,490 --> 00:03:55,600
I want the pages on either side of it, too.

29
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:03,110
I'll get the full scan. This copy cuts off at the margin.

30
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:28,570
It's a call to my mom. Her number's on there. Any chance I can call tonight?

31
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:39,240
You're on the morning list. Can't say what time.
